\strong{OTN tagging sheets and detection extracts.} The OTN tagging template
often leaves \code{ANIMAL_ID} blank, while the OTN matched extract names each
animal by its \code{catalogNumber}. Read such a sheet with
\code{missing_id = "transmitter"}: \code{\link[=detset]{detset()}} then warns that the extract's
\code{animal_id} disagrees with the animals table, and \code{\link[=filter_release]{filter_release()}},
